{"id": "UgzHoUeC9BeNevMdzUx4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 4, "text": "지혜롭게 음식하시 며 알려 주시는.\n모습에 감사를 드립니다. 한 가지 부탁이 있는데 미국에서도  많은 사람들이 보고 있습니다. 같은 고기를 살려고 하는데 영어로는 뭐라고 표시되어 있는지 고기 이름을 알고 싶습니다", "published": "2026-11-17T14:30:45", "replies": 3, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgzHoUeC9BeNevMdzUx4AaABAg.AdJeT5VFjQUAdJm2nlvCux", "parent": "UgzHoUeC9BeNevMdzUx4AaABAg", "likes": 2, "text": "Thank you so much for your kind words! 😊\nI'm so happy and grateful to hear that people in the United States are watching my videos too!\n\nThe meat I used in this recipe is Beef Rib Fingers, also known as Boneless Beef Short Ribs. You may be able to find it under either name at your local butcher or grocery store.\n\nI'll do my best to include English names for ingredients in my future videos so that viewers from other countries can follow along more easily.\n\nThank you again for watching and leaving such a thoughtful comment! ❤️", "published": "2026-11-17T15:37:04", "replies": 0, "creator": true}
